<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Auchan/IFIL Italian retail deal.</title>
<headline>EU clears Auchan/IFIL Italian retail deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared a proposal under which French family-owned hypermarket chain Auchan and IFIL, the holding company of Italy's Agnelli family, will form an Italian retail group.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, the companies' retail and do-it-yourself activities in Italy will be transferred to the new group which will be 51-percent controlled by IFIL.</p>
<p>The commission said in a statement that in view of the position of the companies in the markets concerned and the existence of major competitors, the operation would not create a dominant position in Italy.</p>
</text>
